wardenname=The Sky Warden
wardenintro1=Hm. Stairs. Nobody has taken the stairs in a long, long while.
wardenintro2=I am the Warden. The last one, if you keep count. I keep the light. Kept, rather. It went out with the storm.
wardenintro3=Take this windsilk. You climbed all this way; it would be rude to send you off with empty pockets.
wardenbeacon1=The beacon crystal shattered in the Great Storm. Without it, the isles drift dark and the wisps grow bold.
wardenbeacon2=Bring me storm shards and windsilk - <shards> shards, <silk> silk - and I will teach the old light to burn again.
wardenbeaconwait=Shards and silk, friend. The mist keeps what falls, so mind your step out there.
wardenbeacondone=There. See how it burns - cold and steady, the way the Skywatch liked it. You have my thanks, and my shelves: whatever I can spare is yours to buy.
wardencats1=Two shadows are missing from this tower. My cats. The storm frightened them off and they have not found their way home.
wardencats2=Siggi is the black one - he will be sulking somewhere in the Stormveil, between the crystals. Peanut chases glowmoths in the Aurora Shoals.
wardencats3=They will not come for calling. Cloudpuff treats, that is the trick - windsilk and aurora petals, whisked. Here, I will show you the recipe.
wardencats4=Last I saw them from the roof: Siggi drifted off to the <blackdir> of here, Peanut to the <tabbydir>. Old eyes, but the mist does not move THAT much.
wardencatswait=Any sign of them? Siggi should be to the <blackdir>, Peanut to the <tabbydir>. The treats, do not forget the treats.
wardenonecat=One little shadow home. The tower feels warmer already. The other is still out there somewhere.
wardencatsdone=Both of them, home. Look at them pretend they were never gone. Take this basket - they have claimed it anyway - and this bell. It was Siggi's. He hates it.
wardenanchor1=One more task, if your legs still carry you. The isles drift because the anchors cracked. I can reforge one - with aetherium, and good skystone.
wardenanchor2=Five bars of aetherium and twenty skystone, and this island will hold its place in the wind for another hundred years.
wardenanchorwait=Aetherium and skystone. The forge remembers, even if my hands are slow.
wardenanchordone=It holds. Feel that? The island stopped wandering. The Skywatch would have made a ceremony of this. I will make tea instead.
wardenfinale=You have done old work, the kind nobody sees until it is missing. Keep the banner - and keep your blade close. The storm that broke the anchors was no weather. She is still out there, beyond the veil.
wardenshopclosed=My shelves are dark, like everything else here. Light the beacon first.
wardencatfound1=Mrrp?
wardencattreat=The cat snatches the treat and vanishes in a puff of cloud - homeward.
wardencatnotreat=The cat eyes you warily. It clearly expects a snack.
